# Favorite Cricket Players MERN Project - Learning Notes

## Project Goal

Build a full-stack MERN application where users can:

-   Sign up
-   Log in securely
-   Store their favorite cricket players
-   View only their own players
-   Edit their own players
-   Delete their own players

------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Technologies Used

## Backend

-   Node.js
-   Express.js
-   MongoDB
-   Mongoose
-   bcrypt
-   JSON Web Token (JWT)
-   dotenv
-   cors
-   nodemon

## Frontend

-   React
-   Vite
-   React Router DOM
-   JavaScript
-   CSS

------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Project Phases

## Phase 1 - Backend Setup

-   Create Express server
-   Connect MongoDB
-   Configure environment variables
-   Test database connection

## Phase 2 - User Authentication

-   Signup
-   Login
-   Password hashing
-   JWT generation

## Phase 3 - User Model

-   Name
-   Email
-   Password

## Phase 4 - Authentication Middleware

-   Read JWT
-   Verify token
-   Protect routes

## Phase 5 - Player Model

-   Player Name
-   Runs
-   Strike Rate
-   International Status
-   Owner ID

## Phase 6 - Create Player

-   POST API
-   Save player
-   Attach logged-in user as owner

## Phase 7 - Read Players

-   GET API
